1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,565
And the bundles are scattered all through it.

2
00:00:02,565 --> 00:00:11,132
Many of them, and unequal: small and crowded near the edge, large and widely spaced towards the centre.

3
00:00:11,132 --> 00:00:14,661
This scattered arrangement is called an atactostele.

